        "type": "title",
        "heading": "KANE v LEWANDOWSKI",
        "sub": "Bayern · 2025-26 v 2019-20",
        "pill": "SETTLED",
        "person": "lewa"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Robert Lewandowski, twenty nineteen, twenty. Fifty-five goals in all competitions.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "LEWANDOWSKI 2019-20",
        "person": "lewa",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "55",
            "l": "goals, all comps"
          },
          {
            "n": "34",
            "l": "Bundesliga goals"
          },
          {
            "n": "15",
            "l": "Champions League goals"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bayern won everything. League, cup, and the Champions League. Including an eight-two against Barcelona.",
